# HỌC VNWATCH — outputs/vnwatch-backend/requests/catalog.http
# Mẫu request cho REST Client: dòng method/URL chọn endpoint, header truyền metadata, JSON là body; ### ngăn các request riêng.
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### Liveness (public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/health/live

### Readiness queries PostgreSQL (public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/health/ready

### Fresh demo: 2 products, 3 active SKUs
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products

### Expected: one product, DEMO-EVERYDAY-BLACK at 1,500,000 VND
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products?maxPriceVnd=2000000&q=everyday

### Expected: no matching SKU
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products?minPriceVnd=2000000&maxPriceVnd=3000000

### Pagination, deterministic sort
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products?page=1&limit=1&sort=name_asc

### Active product detail
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products/10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001

### Sold out: still visible, inStock=false
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products/10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002

### Discontinued: 404 PRODUCT_NOT_FOUND
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products/10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003

### 400 VALIDATION_ERROR, Vietnamese message and X-Request-ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products?limit=51

### 400 INVALID_PRICE_RANGE
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products?minPriceVnd=200&maxPriceVnd=100

### OpenAPI
GET {{baseUrl}}/docs-json
